#: kcmkonsole.cpp:114
msgid ""
"<h1>konsole</h1> With this module you can configure konsole, the KDE "
"terminal application. In this module you can configure the generic konsole "
"options, that you can configure using the RMB too, and you can edit the "
"konsole schema."
